OL,3,GNEWSABattening down the hatches before
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra safety measures have been set up
OL,7,Fby people and businesses as they
OL,8,Fprepare for the UK's first named storm
OL,9,Fof the season.
OL,11,FA red weather warning for wind has been
OL,12,Fissued in the Channel Islands ahead of
OL,13,FStorm Austen, while there is an amber
OL,14,Fwarning from early on Friday of gusts
OL,15,Fof up to 80mph (130km/h) and heavy rain
OL,16,Facross parts of Cornwall and Devon.
OL,18,FThe conditions are also set to affect
OL,19,Fparts of Wales, England's south coast,
OL,20,FWiltshire and Somerset.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
